models.py:5:5-5:21: DM001 nullable-model-field: model field `note` explicitly admits None; help: represent absence as an explicit model variant or document a design exception; docs: https://github.com/mpecovnik/ddd-lint/blob/main/docs/rules/dm001-nullable-model-field.md
